RULE Do not rewrite, convert, activate or delete the Books in `agents/.legacy/` to silence those accepted warnings, and do not ask the owner about them again; report them as accepted. Diagnose only errors or new kinds of problems there.
KNOWLEDGE Until {Ignore uncommitted deletions when listing project Books — 2026-10-21 22:14:01} is done, `ptbk lint` reports tracked Books that you deleted or moved but did not commit yet as "Unreadable Book: ENOENT" warnings. For the result lint will show after the commit, run it with your changes staged in a temporary copy of the Git index: `cp .git/index /tmp/idx && GIT_INDEX_FILE=/tmp/idx git add -A -- agents tasks && GIT_INDEX_FILE=/tmp/idx node bin/ptbk.js lint --json`.
